([CASE STUDY 3: 60-Second Elevator Pitch for Clean Energy EV Charging]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Elevator Pitch Script:) Tj
T*
('Did you know that 60% of city apartment dwellers want to buy an electric vehicle, but) Tj
T*
(can't because they don't have dedicated garage parking to charge at night?) Tj
T*
(I'm Rohan from VoltStreet, and we've solved urban charging without tearing up sidewalks.) Tj
T*
(We designed modular, tamper-proof charging sockets that retrofit directly into existing) Tj
T*
(street lamp-posts in under 30 minutes, utilizing nighttime excess streetlamp grid) Tj
T*
(capacity.) Tj
T*
(For city councils, it requires zero capital expenditure on trenching. For drivers, it) Tj
T*
(provides overnight curbside charging at 30% lower cost than fast-charging stations.) Tj
T*
(In our 6-month pilot with New Delhi Municipal Council, our 40 lamp-post chargers powered) Tj
T*
(12,000 miles of clean transit with 99.4% uptime.) Tj
T*
(We are raising $500,000 to scale across 500 lamp-posts across North India. Join us in) Tj
T*
(making EV ownership universal.') Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
