([CASE STUDY 4: Complete Capstone Design Thinking Project Synthesis]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Project Title: Agriview - Drone-based Hyperspectral Crop Disease Diagnosis.) Tj
T*
(Complete Design Lifecycle Synthesis:) Tj
T*
(1. Empathize: Interviewed 40 smallholder farmers; observed devastating crop losses) Tj
T*
(caused by yellow rust fungus detected too late.) Tj
T*
(2. Define: Smallholder farmers need early asymptomatic crop disease detection because by) Tj
T*
(the time rust is visible to the human eye, 50% of the harvest is destroyed.) Tj
T*
(3. Ideate: Brainstormed 80 concepts via SCAMPER; selected lightweight multispectral) Tj
T*
(drone imaging paired with offline edge smartphone diagnosis.) Tj
T*
(4. Prototype: Built Lo-Fi cardboard camera mounts; developed a Wizard-of-Oz mobile app) Tj
T*
(where farmers received manual expert diagnostic SMS within 1 hour.) Tj
T*
(5. Test: Tested across 5 villages; refined interface based on Feedback Capture Matrix to) Tj
T*
(replace text alerts with color-coded audio voice notes.) Tj
T*
(6. Refactor & Pitch: Packaged as a cooperative subscription model pitching to) Tj
T*
(agricultural credit banks, securing $50,000 in regional grant funding.) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
